1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,645
Thermodynamics tells you whether a reaction can happen.

2
00:00:03,645 --> 00:00:06,080
It says nothing about how long it takes.

3
00:00:06,080 --> 00:00:09,440
That missing half of the story is chemical kinetics.

4
00:00:09,440 --> 00:00:14,296
By the end of this lesson, you will see the barrier that guards every diamond.

